          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பரிந்துரை — parinturai — \"to recommend\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "மருத்துவர் இந்த மருந்தைப் பரிந்துரைத்தார். maruttuvar inta maruntaip parinturaittār. The doctor recommended this medicine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): பரிந்துரைத்தேன், parinturaittēṉ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The same word is the noun a recommendation: அவருடைய பரிந்துரை (parinturai)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பரிந்துரை (parinturai) is native: parintu, \"having felt for\", from pari, \"to be affectionate\" (DEDR 3964), joined to urai, \"to speak\" (DEDR 648): to speak up for someone or something."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
