          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ஆலோசி (ālōci) is a verb built on Sanskrit ālocana, \"seeing; considering, reflection\" (Monier-Williams), with the loan-verb ending -இ. The noun ஆலோசனை means \"advice\"."
